.DS_Store
pipeline_info/*.{html,json,txt,yml}

# FastQC outputs (zips and HTML vary by path to nested dir; hashes drift across runners)
**/*_fastqc.{html,zip}

# STAR genome index log (non-deterministic across CPU / compiler)
**/star/Log.out

# BSJ detection: FUSIONJUNC_<n> names, row order and sample column order vary between runs
# (the combined BED is compared as parsed content in default.nf.test)
**/*.combined.bed
**/all_samples.upset.png
**/all_samples.upset_mqc.json
**/circexplorer2.csv
**/*circexplorer2*.bed

# Quantification: psirc bootstrapping + tximport/tximeta + merged tables vary between runs
# (key tables are compared as parsed content in default.nf.test)
**/abundance.h5
**/abundance.tsv
**/run_info.json
**/pseudoalignments.bam
**/pseudoalignments.bam.bai
**/tximport/*.tsv
**/tximeta/*.rds
**/experiments.merged.rds
**/max.tsv
**/sum.tsv
**/circular.tsv
**/linear.tsv
**/{gene,tx}_{counts,tpm}.csv
